 "sentences": [
  {
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 4.52,
   "text": "After a bad night, the worst thing you can do is sleep in. Here's how to get through the next day"
  },
  {
   "s": 4.52,
   "e": 10.04,
   "text": "instead, and it starts the moment your alarm goes off. Say you slept 4 hours, so you sleep in until"
  },
  {
   "s": 10.04,
   "e": 14.82,
   "text": "11, nap for 2 hours after lunch and go to bed early to catch up, it feels smart, but at 1 in"
  },
  {
   "s": 14.82,
   "e": 19.86,
   "text": "the morning you're wide awake again, one bad night just became 2. So here's what works step 1,"
  },
  {
   "s": 20.02,
   "e": 24.82,
   "text": "get up at your usual time anyway, 7.30 same as always, you'll feel rough for an hour and that's"
  },
  {
   "s": 24.82,
   "e": 30.22,
   "text": "ok. Step 2, get daylight in the first 10 minutes, open the curtains or take your coffee outside."
  },
  {
   "s": 30.94,
   "e": 35.64,
   "text": "Step 3, if you need a nap keep it short, 20 minutes before 3 in the afternoon with an alarm."
  },
  {
   "s": 36.16,
   "e": 41.34,
   "text": "And tonight, should you go to bed early? No, go to bed at your normal time, 11.30 not 9,"
  },
  {
   "s": 41.7,
   "e": 45.94,
   "text": "by then you're tired enough to actually fall asleep. Do that and the bad night stays one"
  },
  {
   "s": 45.94,
   "e": 51.46,
   "text": "bad night, you're asleep by midnight and the next morning feels normal again. Here are the 3 rules"
  },
  {
   "s": 51.46,
   "e": 56.52,
   "text": "up at your usual time, a 20 minute nap before 3 your normal bedtime, send this to the friend"
  },
  {
   "s": 56.52,
   "e": 62.1,
   "text": "who texted you at 4 am last night. That's what demure is for, you archive your dream today so"
  },
  {
   "s": 62.1,
   "e": 67.1,
   "text": "you can see it tomorrow and break it down into small steps you can actually do. And follow because"
  },
  {
   "s": 67.1,
   "e": 71.46,
   "text": "this afternoon's reel is the 5 minute check that finds money you're losing every month."
  },
  {
   "s": 71.46,
   "e": 74.46,
   "text": "If you want to try it out, I've put the link in the bio."
  }
 ],
